</p><!----></hc-network-order-step-private-network></div></hc-stepper-step><hc-stepper-step _ngcontent-ng-c2159898667="" data-test="select-ssh-key-step" class="stepper-step" _nghost-ng-c3561588725="" id="hc-stepper-step-4" style="--intersection-ratio: 0;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3561588725="" class="step-header"><hc-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3561588725="" iconclass="hc-stepper-step-heading-icon" class="step-header__icon"><svg role="img" class="hc-icon hc-icon-exclamation-circle hc-stepper-step-heading-icon ng-star-inserted" aria-label="exclamation-circle"><use xlink:href="#exclamation-circle"></use></svg><!----></hc-icon><div _ngcontent-ng-c3561588725="" class="step-header__heading">SSH keys</div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3561588725="" class="step-content"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3561588725="" class="substeps"></div><p _ngcontent-ng-c2159898667="" class="stepper-step__custom-description">Use SSH keys for secure and efficient authentication. Ensure the key is in OpenSSH format. If you add an SSH key, no root credentials will be sent via email. <a href="https://docs.hetzner.com/cloud/servers/faq/#why-did-i-not-receive-a-root-password-after-server-creation" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Learn more.</a></p><hc-callout _ngcontent-ng-c2159898667="" class="hc-callout--card hc-callout--warning stepper-step__custom-description ng-tns-c2159898667-4 ng-trigger ng-trigger-slideUpDown ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3309584202=""><h4 _ngcontent-ng-c3309584202="" class="hc-callout__headline ng-star-inserted" style="">No SSH key selected.</h4><!----> We recommend using an SSH key. Otherwise you will receive the root password via email. </hc-callout><!----><hc-select-items-on-create _ngcontent-ng-c2159898667="" class="ng-untouched ng-pristine ng-valid"><div class="select-box-wrapper ng-untouched ng-pristine ng-valid"><!----><!----><hc-add-sshkey _ngcontent-ng-c2159898667="" class="ng-tns-c2159898667-4 ng-star-inserted"><!----><hc-dashed-add-button class="hc-button hc-button--das