g-tns-c2159898667-4 ng-star-inserted">There are no Firewalls in this project yet. Go to <a href="https://console.hetzner.com/projects/14830510/firewalls">Firewalls</a> to create your first one.</div><!----><!----><!----></div></hc-select-items-on-create></div></hc-stepper-step><hc-stepper-step _ngcontent-ng-c2159898667="" class="stepper-step" _nghost-ng-c3561588725="" id="hc-stepper-step-7" style="--intersection-ratio: 0;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3561588725="" class="step-header"><hc-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3561588725="" iconclass="hc-stepper-step-heading-icon" class="step-header__icon"><svg role="img" class="hc-icon hc-icon-tick-unchecked hc-stepper-step-heading-icon ng-star-inserted" aria-label="tick-unchecked"><use xlink:href="#tick-unchecked"></use></svg><!----></hc-icon><div _ngcontent-ng-c3561588725="" class="step-header__heading">Backups</div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3561588725="" class="step-content"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3561588725="" class="substeps"></div><p _ngcontent-ng-c2159898667="" class="stepper-step__custom-description">Backups are daily automatic copies of your server's disk. With Backups, you can easily restore a server to a previous state or use it to create a new server. <a href="https://docs.hetzner.com/cloud/servers/backups-snapshots/faq" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Learn more.</a></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c2159898667="" class="stepper-step__custom-description"> Backups cost an additional 20&nbsp;% of the server price. Volumes are not included in backups. </p><hc-checkbox _ngcontent-ng-c2159898667="" data-test="create-enable-backups" class="ng-untouched ng-pristine ng-valid"><span class="hc-checkbox hc-checkbox--help-text"><span errortooltip="" class="hc-checkbox"><input type="checkbox"><label data-test="checkbox-label-and-icon"><div class="hc-checkbox-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.5" d="M4 1.25h10A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 16.75 4v10A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 14 16.75H4A2.75 2.75 0 0